# Tooling & Enforcement

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| **EditorConfig** | Consistent formatting across editors |
| **StyleCop / Roslyn Analyzers** | Automated standards checks at build time |
| **SonarQube / SonarCloud** | Code quality and security scanning |
| **Husky + lint-staged** | Pre-commit hook to block non-compliant commits |
| **dotnet format** | Auto-format code on demand |

Run `dotnet format` before every commit. CI pipelines must fail on analyzer warnings.
